00:13:13.455 --> 00:13:15.990
You have to move with courage,

00:13:15.990 --> 00:13:18.279
with faith, with determination,

00:13:18.279 --> 00:13:20.270
in connection with carrying out

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:22.142
